# Cursor AI Rules for Native AOT CLI Template

- Language: C# 14 / .NET 10
- Target: Native AOT (Ahead-of-Time compilation, JIT disabled)
- CLI Framework: ConsoleAppFramework (Source Generator based)
- Serialization: ALWAYS use System.Text.Json Source Generation via AppJsonContext. NEVER use reflection JsonSerializer without JsonTypeInfo.
- Central Package Management: Specify package versions exclusively in Directory.Packages.props.
- Output: Support dual-mode output via ConsoleOutput (Spectre.Console for human UI, pure JSON for --json / agent mode).
- Testing: Write unit tests in tests/unit and integration tests in tests/integration using TestConsoleContext.
- Always run `dotnet test` and ensure 0 warnings / 0 errors before finishing code edits.
